Modifications: the strategy examples (weights/, orders/, walkforward/) and the
backtest engine (engine/) were translated from Python to TypeScript. The
pandas-based code was rewritten on a small Frame matrix type (core/frame.ts),
the cloud data client, plotting, CLI, reporting and Optuna optimizer were
dropped, and some behavior differs; see README.md for the known differences.
